'''Calvin''' is an [[NPC]] that can appear on the {{Zone|Private Island}}. They offer rewards for players who return after {{Green|90+}} days being offline.

== Usage ==
Interacting with '''Calvin''' allows the player to claim rewards and buffs. All buffs last for {{Green|7 days}}.

The following rewards and buffs are granted:
* {{Coins|+500k|2.5m}}
* {{stat|global wisdom|+5–25}} (excluding XP from minions)
* {{Green|+5–25%}} [[Slayer|Slayer XP]]
* {{Green|+5–25%}} [[Dungeoneering|Dungeon XP]]
* {{Green|+5–25%}} [[Classes|Dungeon Class XP]]

The buffs scale with offline time:<ref>{{Cite Discord
